 "final": "I booked Dana Lee's trip, and both reservations are confirmed:\n\n- **Flight R0001:** F100, nonstop SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A one-stop flight was cheaper at $199, but you asked for nonstop.\n- **Hotel R0002:** Midtown Lodge (H1) in New York, $189/night for 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12. Total $378. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nThe flight and hotel ended up as two separate bookings, not one combined trip. The combined booking request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. Retrying the combined request could have booked the flight twice, so I booked the hotel on its own. I checked again afterwards: there are just these two bookings, with no duplicates.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LPVfzpfqi9okjRgNqw3KdE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019NyEw9US6VYtASj4Z7iqjo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0124L5g51PXp8c6NHomrtUJ6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HqXJUjsis9Vfy1zxdR1h2x", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "type":